OL,3,GNEWSACouncil bin collection fuel bill
OL,4,Aset for #200,000 rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FFuel costs to run a Kent council's bin
OL,7,Fcollection service are set to rise by
OL,8,Fan extra #200,000 next year due to
OL,9,Fconflict in the Middle East.
OL,11,FResidents in Canterbury, Whitstable and
OL,12,FHerne Bay could bear the brunt of
OL,13,Frising prices after plans were revealed
OL,14,Fas part of Canterbury City Council's
OL,15,F(CCC) draft budget proposals, which
OL,16,Finclude a 2.97% rise in council tax.
OL,18,FThe authority has been urged to "root
OL,19,Fout waste" in its contract with
OL,20,FCanenco, the company which runs
OL,21,Fresidential bin collection and street
OL,22,Fcleaning in the district.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
