OL,3,GNEWSACouncil bin collection fuel bill
OL,4,Aset for #200,000 rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FA CCC spokesperson said: "The #200,000
OL,7,Fon fuel increases is based on
OL,8,Fassumptions for next year, but remains
OL,9,Funder review within a very volatile
OL,10,Ffuel market."
